        return dp[n]
```

**Time:** O(n)
**Space:** O(n)
:::

:::details 3. Two variables (optimal)
Each step only needs the previous two values, so keep just those two and roll them forward.

**Java**

```java
class Solution {
    public int climbStairs(int n) {
        int prev = 1, cur = 1; // ways(i-1), ways(i)
        for (int i = 2; i <= n; i++) {
            int next = prev + cur;
            prev = cur;
            cur = next;
        }
        return cur;
    }
}
```

