**Time/Space:** O(n) / O(1)

**Pitfall:** A HashSet works but violates the O(1)-space follow-up.

**Pattern:** Clear lowest set bit

**Key insight:** n & (n-1) drops the lowest 1, so loop once per set bit.

**Java**

```java
class Solution {
    public int hammingWeight(int n) {
        int c = 0;
        while (n != 0) { n &= n - 1; c++; }
        return c;
    }
}
```

