**Time/Space:** O(set bits) / O(1)

**Pitfall:** With signed ints, use != 0 (not > 0) and >>> rather than >> if shifting.

**Pattern:** DP on bits

**Key insight:** bits[i] = bits[i >> 1] + (i & 1).

**Java**

```java
class Solution {
    public int[] countBits(int n) {
        int[] res = new int[n + 1];
        for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) res[i] = res[i >> 1] + (i & 1);
        return res;
    }
}
```

